§ `Section 63C: notice of increase in total amount paid up on shares`

-- Arguments: private company; issued a partly paid or unpaid share; subsequently received all or part of the unpaid amount; the day the payment was received; the notice has been lodged; the day it was lodged; the day on which the question is asked.
-- the payment of 1 March 2026 gives until 15 March 2026 (14 days after the payment)
#ASSERT `s 63C the private company is late in lodging the notice of the increase in the total amount paid up` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
